# =====================================================================================
# v1_denotatum_provenance_neg.ttl — the FAILING NEGATIVE fixture for V1DenotatumHygieneShape
# (W2 · SP0, T-SHAPES; V1 REFINED, design §4/§7.5, maintainer lock). The materialized RED
# (D24: sh:conforms true alone is vacuous).
# =====================================================================================
# A DENOTATUM (rec:denotatum:record, B4 Plane-2 mathematical object) that WRONGLY carries provenance:
# a @rel:created triple (the SINGLE injected violation). Merged onto the algebra data graph the graph
# MUST NOT conform: V1DenotatumHygieneShape (sh:targetClass rec:denotatum:record) has maxCount 0 on
# @rel:created (provenance NEVER on a denotatum — 'Group was not authored by an executor; the
# GroupTermRecord was', D24; design §4 V1 REFINED / §7.5) and reddens. To ISOLATE the provenance
# violation, the denotatum carries a valid fnd: alias bridge (skos:exactMatch) so BridgeShape does NOT
# also fire — the ONLY tooth that bites is the V1 provenance-on-a-denotatum prohibition.
#
# This is the complement of the PERMITTED B4 model-record (owl:Class + rec:model:record + provenance,
# legal OWL2 metaclass punning, EXEMPT): those are rec:declaration:record, disjoint from
# rec:denotatum:record, so V1DenotatumHygieneShape never targets them.
#
# Depth-gate compliance: the subject is an owl:NamedIndividual with a SPECIFIC type (rec:denotatum:record).

@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix fnd:  <urn:silmaril:fnd:#> .
@prefix rel:  <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:relation:> .
@prefix rec:  <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:grounding:ontology:basic:formal:domain:knowledge:representation:kingdom:specification:phylum:formal:contract:class:class:order:declared:family:seed:genus:registry:species:> .

# --- a denotatum WRONGLY carrying provenance (INVALID: @rel:created on a Plane-2 mathematical object) ---
<urn:silmaril:fixture:algebra:v1:denotatum:provenance:negative>
    a owl:NamedIndividual , rec:denotatum:record ;
    rel:notation   "denotatum wrongly carrying provenance" ;
    rel:identifier "urn:silmaril:fixture:algebra:v1:denotatum:provenance:negative" ;
    skos:exactMatch fnd:V1TestDenotatum ;  # a valid fnd: bridge so BridgeShape does NOT fire; isolates the provenance violation
    rel:created "2026-09-06T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .  # INJECTED VIOLATION: provenance never on a denotatum
